          plot_results.m (Fig.6), via run_stage06_reporting
          -> results/reporting/figures/fig6_oh_outputs.*

   17   Oh [13] — all inputs
          plot_results.m (Fig.7), via run_stage06_reporting
          -> results/reporting/figures/fig7_oh_inputs.*

